{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1428 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "18006d2f6b4a63863378ddb50969bd33ae4b1d77404644200d9b20c3b935ed86" :edb/db-before-t 1427 :edb/db-after-t 1428 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534740 50 #inst "2026-10-08T05:33:05.723Z" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306712 1017 #edb/ref 17592186306713 13194139534740 false] [17592186306712 1017 #edb/ref 17592186306901 13194139534740 true] [17592186306712 1100 "A car accelerates from rest at the origin with an acceleration of $(3i-4j)\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ and an initial velocity of $2i\\,\\text{m/s}.$ Find the distance from the car to the origin$(|r|)$ after $4$ seconds.\n\n$\\,|r|=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\text{m}$" 13194139534740 false] [17592186306712 1100 "A car accelerates from the origin with an acceleration of $(3i-4j)\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ and an initial velocity of $2i\\,\\text{m/s}.$ Find the distance from the car to the origin$(|r|)$ after $4$ seconds.\n\n$\\,|r|=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\text{m}$" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306712 1145 "If a particle moves with constant acceleration $a,$ the position vector of the particle at time $t$ can be found using\n\n$$\nr={r}_{0}+ut+\\frac{1}{2}a{t}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhere ${r}_{0}$ is the initial position of the particle and $u$ is its initial velocity.\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{r}_{0}=0i+0j,\\,u=2i,\\,a=3i-4j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the position vector of the car after $t=4\\,\\text{s}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =(0i+0j)+(2i)(4)+\\frac{1}{2}(3i-4j)(4)^{2} \\\\  & =8i+8(3i-4j) \\\\  & =8i+24i-32j \\\\  & =(32i-32j)\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance from the car to the origin at this time is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r| & =|32i-32j| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(32)^{2}+(-32)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1024+1024} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2048} \\\\  & =32\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534740 false] [17592186306712 1145 "With constant acceleration, the position is\n\n$$\n\\mathbf r(t)=\\mathbf r_0+\\mathbf u t+\\tfrac12\\mathbf a t^2.\n$$\n\nHere $\\mathbf r_0=\\mathbf0$, $\\mathbf u=2\\mathbf i\\,\\mathrm{m/s}$, and $\\mathbf a=(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}$. At $t=4\\,\\mathrm{s}$,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf r(4)&=\\mathbf0+(2\\mathbf i)(4)+\\tfrac12(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)(4^2)\\\\\n&=8\\mathbf i+24\\mathbf i-32\\mathbf j\\\\\n&=(32\\mathbf i-32\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe distance to the origin is therefore\n\n$$\n|\\mathbf r(4)|=\\sqrt{32^2+(-32)^2}=\\sqrt{2048}=\\boxed{32\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm m}.\n$$" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306902 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306903 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1041 "field-1" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1104 #edb/ref 17592186306903 13194139534740 true] [17592186306901 1110 #uuid "8c48f7c3-575c-5400-b00a-eaa29762f740" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306902 1034 "32" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534740 true] [17592186306902 1111 #uuid "8665a0d8-1aa1-5748-a7f9-5735334bc012" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306903 1034 "32\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534740 true] [17592186306903 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534740 true] [17592186306903 1111 #uuid "f84ef709-80ec-5e5c-9f54-a7704bfb0dd9" 13194139534740 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1" 17592186306901 "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-0" 17592186306902 "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-1" 17592186306903}}
